; lib_core: what ix's programs share, split as xix's lib_core.
; commons/ is ix's own (Common, Console, Procs...), the ix_core
; library. The others are the stdlib, ocaml-light's (units.txt), which
; mini-ml compiles and links (plan_ml_bootstrap.md, decision 9); the
; programs built by dune have OCaml's, so dune doesn't look here.
; parallel/ is dune's alone (Parallel: the host's cores, by OCaml's
; Domain where there is one), not a unit of mini-ml's.
